---
title: FERB 0.26 — one request from full words to evidence
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Owner
    participant RPC as Daemon RPC
    participant S as Supervisor / approach
    participant DB as Stores / context sources
    participant M as Planner / worker models
    participant G as Harness gateway
    participant D as Target driver
    participant Obs as Disturbance sentinel
    participant V as Outcome checker
    Owner->>RPC: Full request
    RPC->>S: Conversation and original payload
    S->>DB: Retrieve memory/history, preserve intake receipts
    S->>M: Token-budgeted blocks, protected request, fetch references
    M-->>S: Task specification and outcome conditions
    S->>DB: Persist request, specification, actual prompt
    S->>Obs: Start task observation
    loop Worker-selected actions and recovery
        S->>M: Full request, specification, artifacts, prior facts
        M->>G: Tool call with explicit target/source/method
        G->>Obs: Sample before action; record span association
        G->>D: Validate and execute exactly chosen mechanism
        D-->>G: Observations, source receipt or structured refusal
        G->>DB: Redacted full action/result, ledger delivery state
        G->>Obs: Sample after action
        G-->>M: Facts; delivery is not outcome proof
        opt Ambiguous identity or hard-to-undo confirmation
            M->>S: Candidate evidence and proposed concrete action
            S->>Owner: Unresolved what/who/which or confirmation
            Owner-->>S: Answer carried across retries
        end
    end
    M-->>S: Completion claim, artifacts, evidence
    S->>V: Full request, conditions, intake receipts, artifacts
    V->>DB: Retrieve actual task/source evidence
    V->>G: Inspect state when required
    V-->>S: True / false / unknown per outcome, with evidence
    alt Unresolved outcome
        S->>M: Recovery judgment or explicit blocker
    else Established outcome
        S->>D: Release owned resources; keep explicit handoffs
        D-->>S: Cleanup facts and errors
        S->>M: Reconcile resource consequences
    end
    S->>D: Idempotent final cleanup
    S->>Obs: Final sample and summary
    Obs->>DB: Changes, unavailable fields, correlations, coverage
    S->>DB: Final outcome, all unresolved conditions retained
    S-->>RPC: Truthful answer and artifact facts
    RPC-->>Owner: Failed/unknown conditions before any summary
    Note over RPC,DB: trace --json exports request, decisions, actions, checks, disturbances, cleanup; owner verdict remains null
    Note over Owner,Obs: Explicit stop can interrupt; sentinel records facts without blocking or restoring focus
